  <tmdoc-title|The <name|PowerShell> plug-in>

  The <name|PowerShell> plug-in provides interactive PowerShell sessions in
  <TeXmacs>. It is available on Windows when <verbatim|powershell.exe> or
  <verbatim|pwsh.exe> is on <verbatim|PATH>.
